<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Marchez en direction de la mer.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les moyens de transport", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Vous pouvez aller d'un endroit \u00e0 un autre en utilisant diff\u00e9rents moyens de transport.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Transport\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"voiture\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">en voiture</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">prendre sa voiture</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"train\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">en train<br/>prendre le train</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">en bus<br/>prendre le bus</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bateau\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">en bateau</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">prendre le bateau</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"taxi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">en taxi</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">prendre un taxi</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"italic\">Ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent voyager en voiture.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"italic\">Prenons un taxi.</span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l'h\u00f4tel de ville", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un b\u00e2timent o\u00f9 le maire et ses conseillers travaillent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'h\u00f4tel de ville est dans la prochaine rue. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Voici des mots dont vous avez besoin pour r\u00e9viser.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la galerie d'art", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un lieu qui expose des peintures et des sculptures", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La galerie d'art expose des peintures de Picasso.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l'intersection", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un endroit o\u00f9 se croisent deux rues", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Retrouve-moi \u00e0 l'intersection de la rue Victor Hugo et de la rue de la Paix.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prendre", "type": "name"}, {"content": "utiliser un moyen de transport", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : O\u00f9 est-ce qu'on prend le bus ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "color\u00e9, color\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui comporte une ou plusieurs couleurs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est une peinture color\u00e9e. Il y a du rouge, de l'orange et du jaune. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la brique", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un mat\u00e9riau de construction de forme rectangulaire \u00e0 base d'argile", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est une belle maison en brique rouge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l'arr\u00eat ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un endroit o\u00f9 un bus ou un m\u00e9tro s'arr\u00eate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Descendez \u00e0 l'arr\u00eat rue Victor Hugo.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la pizzeria", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un restaurant qui sert des pizzas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La pizzeria sert de vraies pizzas italiennes !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Regardez le tableau.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choisissez trois gratte-ciels dans votre ville. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regardez sur Internet ou allez directement \u00e0 ces gratte-ciels.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez de quelles couleurs et mati\u00e8res les gratte-ciels sont faits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez deux phrases sur chaque gratte-ciel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Nom du gratte-ciel</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Couleur(s)</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Mati\u00e8re(s)</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\